WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.707
The Sun's wind.

00:02.407 --> 00:07.098
The Sun blows a thin wind of charged particles past us all the time.

00:07.548 --> 00:15.632
The Earth's magnetic field turns most of it aside and funnels some down around the poles, where it makes the upper air glow.

00:16.082 --> 00:21.952
The green rings are where the aurora is expected in the next hour, from today's forecast.
